  "title": "Dan&#39;s Pork in Tangy Pepperoni and Cashew Sauce",
  "description": "Pork chops are served with a really tasty Italian-style tomato and pepperoni sauce. A sprinkling of cashews is an innovative touch, and a few basil leaves for garnish make it all as lovely as it is delicious!",
